      <activity id="590a1f94-88b0-5445-8d7f-e4d68d41ee05" activityNameId="010002b0-30eb-589b-94bc-af670caf634a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Footpath, gravel pavement, production and installation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Footpath, gravel pavement, production and installation
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: dd37bccb-14c3-4eb0-8d72-6855c96cf0ff
1 m² footpath, gravel pavement. System boundary includes production (A1–A3) and construction/transport phase (A4–A5) for one square metre of installed footpath, including excavation and foundation. Service life time 30 years
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Width 1.5 m incl. foundation; curbstones 12×30 cm; layers: 15 cm reused excavation, 20 cm crushed stone, 5 cm fine gravel; concrete foundation 20×25 cm with curbstone embedded 15 cm centrally. Based on assumptions
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dd37bccb-14c3-4eb0-8d72-6855c96cf0ff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
